# 🩺 Clinzo Care - Doctor Slot Scheduling System

A full-stack MERN application that enables doctors to publish their availability and allows patients to book appointments online. The project demonstrates appointment scheduling, booking management, cancellation, and a clean, responsive user interface.

---

## 📌 Features

### Doctor
- Publish available appointment slots
- View published availability
- Manage appointment schedule

### Patient
- View available appointment slots
- Book an appointment
- Cancel an appointment
- View booking status

---

## 🛠️ Tech Stack

### Frontend
- React.js
- React Router
- Axios
- Tailwind CSS

### Backend
- Node.js
- Express.js

### Database
- MongoDB
- Mongoose

---

