## 🚀 Installation

### Clone Repository

```bash
git clone https://github.com/yourusername/clinzo_care.git
```

---

### Backend Setup

```bash
cd backend
npm install
npm run dev
```

---

### Frontend Setup

```bash
cd frontend
npm install
npm run dev
```

---

## 🔗 API Endpoints

| Method | Endpoint | Description |
|---------|----------|-------------|
| GET | /api/appointments | Get all appointments |
| POST | /api/appointments | Publish availability |
| PUT | /api/appointments/:id/book | Book appointment |
| PUT | /api/appointments/:id/cancel | Cancel appointment |

---

## 🗄️ Database Schema

### Appointment

```
doctor
patient
date
time
booked
createdAt
updatedAt
```

---

## 🏗️ Design Decisions

- MERN stack architecture
- RESTful API design
- MongoDB for flexible document storage
- React component-based UI
- Separate frontend and backend for maintainability

---

## ⚙️ Assumptions

- Each appointment slot belongs to one doctor.
- A slot can only be booked by one patient.
- Booked slots cannot be booked again.
- All times are stored in the server's local timezone.
- Authentication is not included in this implementation.

---

## ⚖️ Trade-offs

- No authentication or authorization.
- No payment integration.
- No email or SMS notifications.
- Uses basic CRUD operations for simplicity.

---

## 🚀 Future Improvements

- User authentication (JWT)
- Doctor profiles
- Slot generation from start/end times
- Buffer time between appointments
- Rescheduling appointments
- Real-time booking updates
- Video consultation integration
- Email and SMS reminders


